      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e if agents are generating incorrect tag style in git commit messages, that\u0027s a bug in the agent.\n\nThat could be true, (I\u0027m not sure if `\u003d` is intentional or not) and maybe the agents should also be updated.\n\nHowever the hook should be defensive here. The hook\u0027s job is to ensure a `Change-Id` exists, not to enforce formatting for the rest of the commit message. Blindly appending a second `Change-Id` only makes the commit message worse.",
      "parentUuid": "38044421_40275295",
      "revId": "f5e489091199dccabe43fca1e8bec484987ac3f9",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
