      "writtenOn": "2026-07-30T23:24:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Gerrit does not reject pushes for such commit messages (that contain a single `Change-Id`).\n\n---\n\n\u003e the hook cannot blindly remove any Change-Id it finds in the commit message. it cannot determine whether it\u0027s supposed to be there (middle of text due to e.g. cherry-pick, or something else), or because some other tool corrupted it.\n\nI\u0027m not suggesting this. This patch simply avoids adding a duplicate Change-Id. It doesn\u0027t remove anything.",
      "parentUuid": "71891415_a8ac3c4a",
      "revId": "f5e489091199dccabe43fca1e8bec484987ac3f9",
